{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23320","headline":"郡中西园 · 白居易","name":"郡中西园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲园多芳草，春夏香靡靡。\n深树足佳禽，旦暮鸣不已。\n院门闭松竹，庭径穿兰芷。\n爱彼池上桥，独来聊徙倚。\n鱼依藻长乐，鸥见人暂起。\n有时舟随风，尽日莲照水。\n谁知郡府内，景物闲如此。\n始悟諠静缘，何尝系远迩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}